===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# {{lb|en|US|baseball}} The path of a [[pitch]] which starts outside and then slides over the [[plate]].
#: {{ux|en|He has a nasty '''back door''' slider.}}
# Achieved through indirect means.
# {{lb|en|poker|of a [[draw]]}} Requiring consecutive cards on the [[turn]] and [[river]] to be achieved.
#: {{ux|en|The [[flop]] had the ace of spades, queen of spades, and two of diamonds, and I was holding the king of spades and the three of hearts. I bet big, hoping for a jack and a ten to make my '''back door''' straight-draw, or a spade to make my '''back door''' flush-draw. But when the turn card was the five of clubs, I had to fold.}}

